      "content_utf8": "Protocol v1 retry contract. A 503 response with TEMPORARY_UNAVAILABLE is retriable. Retry state SCHEDULED and a trusted retry_at mean the sender will make another attempt; wait for that attempt rather than creating a parallel resend. Contact the callback operator only when the attempt limit is reached and the trusted retry state is EXHAUSTED. Correlate response request, event, order and attempt count.\n",
