      "byte_length": 421,
      "content_utf8": "Protocol v2 error handling. A 503 response is retriable only when the server records a retryable failure code and a current retry policy. Retry state SCHEDULED with retry_at is still pending. EXHAUSTED is actionable only when attempt_count reaches max_attempts and the failure response digest/event/request all match the current delivery row. This document describes method; current Domain Evidence decides the incident.\n",
